he home folder.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":17,"oldLines":6,"newStart":17,"newLines":9,"lines":[" Lanes:"," "," - `codex`: Codex CLI (`codex exec --json`), unsandboxed.","+- `codex-sandboxed`: the same Codex run, under the same profile as `kimi`, with","+  an empty scratch HOME and `CODEX_HOME`. Its last message goes to a scratch","+  folder in `/tmp` and is copied into the run folder afterwards."," - `kimi`: Kimi Code. Its output goes to Moonshot, so its shell runs under the","   macOS sandbox profile `sandbox/agent.sb` (no reading or writing the real","   home), with an empty scratch HOME. Kimi's own install and sessions live in"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01WADck2vGdeLsthz3LhYxpr","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
